      "text": "China may have just changed the AI memory game.\n\nTencentDB Agent Memory is open source, runs locally, and uses plain SQLite.\n\nNo Pinecone. No cloud APIs.\n\nThe numbers are wild:\n\n→ 61% fewer tokens\n→ PersonaMem accuracy: 48% → 76%\n→ Zero external API dependencies https://t.co/j6YfQVxuhz",
      "url": "https://x.com/Vidhi2828/status/2115707455200243931"
