      "text": "I turned 58 of my own notes files into a searchable AI memory with ChromaDB. Then I asked it a question grep couldn't answer.\n\n\"How many verified impressions do I need to get paid by X?\"\n\ngrep: 0 results.\nChromaDB: right file, 268 milliseconds.\n\nHere's exactly what I ran, with https://t.co/lTGoC5bwLI",
      "url": "https://x.com/ReignSwords/status/2115891787566858522"
