      "text": "If you're learning AI, study the following:\n\n📌How LLMs actually work\n📌Prompting fundamentals\n📌Context engineering\n📌RAG and embeddings\n📌Tool calling and MCP\n📌AI agents\n📌Evals\n📌Fine-tuning and model choice\n\n👉🏼In that order, basic to advanced",
