      "text": "Someone asked me what the best moment of @Oracle AI World was.\n\nIt wasn’t the announcements, the puppies or the Cybertruck.\n\nIt was six words from a customer after my workshop.\n\n“You’ve just changed everything for me.”\n\nThey had just sat through my session on agent memory in",
