      "text": "🧠 Is agent memory really a better deal than plain RAG?\n\nTitle: Memory Tax: Dissecting the Net Value of Agent Memory\nURL: https://t.co/uqmrRIqiOY\n\n❓ What is the \"net value\" of memory?\n💡 Compared with naive RAG, queries memory newly solves are its \"benefit,\" and queries RAG",
      "url": "https://x.com/cv_usk/status/2116113381388341496"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1412846765758304257",
      "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2115866253617189244"
      ],
      "id": "2115866253617189244",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 28,
        "like_count": 0,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "a paper ran 11 agent memory systems against plain rag over the raw chat history and 90/99 results came in below rag. we built memory os's so the agent could forget what was already in the log",
      "url": "https://x.com/absencelul/status/2115866253617189244"
    },
