        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Fancy agent memory layers often lose to plain RAG over raw chat history — and cost more.\n\nSummaries quietly rewrite dates. Keep events raw; project only for this turn.\n\nDid yours win on YOUR logs, or the blog demo?",
      "url": "https://x.com/EthanColeq9/status/2115496510569758875"
