      "text": "Agent memory fails when retrieval is treated like a magic database lookup. Build RAG as a measured retrieval pipeline with provenance and an explicit fallback when evidence is weak. Explore the complete method in The S\n\nhttps://t.co/wbEvX1LiFp #AIAgents #SelfHostedAI https://t.co/IUlI6wrTMh",
