      "text": "New paper: many dedicated agent memory systems underperform plain RAG over the raw chat history. They call the loss the \"memory tax.\"\n\nWhat I'd do: before adding a memory layer, test it against simple search over the log. Keep whichever wins.\n\nhttps://t.co/5qxm8CscO0 #AIagents",
