      "text": "Tested EverOS Cloud from @evermind for agent memory and this is exactly what I needed - no custom RAG needed.\n\nHooked my support triage agent to ticket #409 (error 403 on sync) and dumped SOPs + old tickets in. It searches memory before it starts, then saves the run after. https://t.co/iO7qn5F4Rp",
      "url": "https://x.com/ameerah2y1/status/2115672229685989789"
