      "text": "AI Terms to Know: Context Engineering\n\nTechnical:\nContext engineering is the practice of controlling what information, instructions, tools, history, and state an AI model receives while performing a task.\n\nIn normal English:\nPrompt engineering was mostly about asking the question",
      "url": "https://x.com/SteveMordue/status/2115464984926785943"
    },
