        "reply_count": 12,
        "retweet_count": 3
      },
      "text": "None of the 11 agent memory systems in a new paper beat plain RAG over the raw chat history on LongMemEval-s.\n\nThe paper is Memory Tax (arXiv 2610.34073). The baseline is basically the boring thing: chunk the raw history, hybrid search, a reranker, and let the model ask one",
      "url": "https://x.com/manthanguptaa/status/2116030102563873160"
